  rectangle "==Trino Gateway Proxy\n<size:21>[Container: Proxy de roteamento]</size>\n\nIntercepta consultas SQL e integra-se com DyraSQL Core" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as DyraSQL.TrinoGatewayProxy
